### Envío a un topic
POST {{host}}/api/push/topic/novedades
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{ "title": "Novedades", "body": "Hay novedades en Cober", "dryRun": true }

### Lectura (la app lo llama con los valores que recibió en data)
POST {{host}}/api/receipts/read
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "12345",
  "sentAt": 1791500000,
  "receipt": "<data.receipt>",
  "deviceToken": "<token FCM>",
  "readAt": "2026-10-08T16:00:00Z"
}
